sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant E as Eureka Server
    participant S as Servicio

    S->>E: POST /eureka/apps/{APP}
    E-->>S: Registro Confirmado

    loop Heartbeat
        S->>E: PUT /eureka/apps/{APP}/{ID}
        E-->>S: Renovación OK
    end

    C->>E: GET /eureka/apps
    E-->>C: Lista de Servicios

    C->>E: GET /eureka/apps/{APP}
    E-->>C: Detalles del Servicio

    Note over C,S: Comunicación directa cliente-servicio

    opt Servicio No Responde
        E->>S: Health Check
        S--xE: Timeout
        E->>E: Eliminar Registro
    end
